{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c1b48a624ea27fd438e855c4d54ce2ef875e5564f54ca29e0b8b4ee57b8504",
      "text": "那个，打扰一下。\n请问各位该不会是Beit吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b886ddefa8c415277e8a39ffc2c3ecba1da4e72b474b931da3d796f3372d7498",
      "text": "咦？是的，确实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eb00721621de2744b6a0d029d18ac004ead6eead9cf0e1e33529d14ff5975ac",
      "text": "果然是！负责做这个展示区的人就是我！\n我从出道起就是Beit的粉丝了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a44dd5c83a6f452a8c4bbc5e364fdd2b832b89ae0d3c32ab2b6b2bd778da5689",
      "text": "哇，真的吗！？能见到你我也好高兴！\n……等等，恭二，你怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f51878322cb8b9b9bdbe0c03f097aa1da233bf0e228ae58c9b5810d32c4db3",
      "text": "啊，没……\n我只是在想，原来我们真的有粉丝在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac3c810dc5594c8779b1be78115f81060841cdc11441a0ba4372ef6d0cef6fc",
      "text": "像这样当面见到还是第一次……\n虽然现在才说有点迟，但感觉终于有了真实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c5e5c128fbc703726d8dfa670aaa554490acc280cd819eedec05f484012f25d",
      "text": "啊哈哈。作为偶像的真实感？\n嘛，我也能理解那种心情啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50759f82794086148d6cf0a7633a81ebeae690c9a43a2f4cf9162cd44361e954",
      "text": "毕竟比起当偶像的时间，\n我当偶像粉丝的时间要长得多嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adce473792d98e299c10325db20291c14f2e3fb0f220dd35e10311da03fc664e",
      "text": "那个，如果不介意的话，\n能让我们拍一下这里的展示专区吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36a63ad3672ffa7433b237f2e5eece145e4b9c14c41f1224a06fba4f167246e",
      "text": "好的，当然没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070dfffe7852ec68efabeebd49a011be0df5e215c7b7d368319255f118818c74",
      "text": "难得来一次，能在展板的某个地方\n签个名吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5fcefe8ddd4609a8448d1fd895a77bd6555b5031098428b2240c8f1619ff758",
      "text": "我也想和展板合影！\n排在一起拍，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:087acbf071c1626a91d6921aba4ac6494eea2a0fc45b18d445f14bbaaf0cca5b",
      "text": "好、好的！\n求之不得！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d3d88ce459f2f0d78646948a600ab165b8ab4029af4c8d43e1756821a9d460b",
      "text": "真的非常感谢！\n签名我们也会好好陈列出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5500168a57c5b4db5bc9cec0d2315286e75399e21870c2fbfac6ce88a181cc52",
      "text": "我也谢谢你——！\n拍照真开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11d9476a3b8789f0779c1b8cb24797b5970a53894f0452fc448a0210a932398",
      "text": "店员，不好意思。关于把拍下的照片\n发到事务所博客上的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35c30ea49ab348224ded867a12a725c6462a479a72c90bf9460f2639f3bba0b8",
      "text": "我询问了负责人，\n对方表示完全没有问题，请务必发布！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157fc61a0e033bb31407c2720d9b6d70dcc9dafb5b0dd53daaa48e3f6ae3c446",
      "text": "太好啦。这样就能让更多人\n看到这么棒的展示了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000183:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:870a32d0e76375b48d6f7aa708eb0950ab5c5eda3e368760b66143959506f234",
      "text": "喂。是我，神乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0b23f31e5a4a632b8fa9c239b39f93f3abfb750b88871e3b544d5e0b618f08e",
      "text": "今天去了唱片店，\n在那里看到了Beit的专区。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c443da422cf596f83b5b2c7516f906cbb62a99730db661404c5edff925fb4ab6",
      "text": "前些天博客上刊登的照片，\n原来就是那家店啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dabc5405de7f727dc85ef549cb00fc372ed6370ff26436d6978020bb00a468fe",
      "text": "装饰得很漂亮，也很引人瞩目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000199:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc10639bbc31ed3437a8baf9d561bd7f94335b825c507db0f14d2e8142519478",
      "text": "真是令人感激的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e3fbcb2ee2ff029c183631a93b75c142d41becafa15d3cb0a69ecdca88bd83",
      "text": "是啊。我们倾注心意的音乐，\n切实传达到了人们心中……真令人欣慰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000203:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8269571819081873f05ec71b15b695174b42a54e9d4e6f01df1193978a5b015",
      "text": "我也必须努力，\n不输给Beit的各位才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000205:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3598dd219cd522eb49a19f1b08860fdb0ecfd965aedda887f835b1213d7a8cba",
      "text": "一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38c922d3f3eab764826ef89891fe0df315427db4ab5b69037d3a8dd04a089112",
      "text": "嗯。\n首先就从明天的练习开始全力以赴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6ac512e267856fc7344e9f7988ae105d5edf04df3c88c64e832aca30e7f9661",
      "text": "突然打电话给你，不好意思。\n那么，明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
